L["A Conspicuous Gravestone"] = "눈에 띄는 묘비"
L["A Crumpled Up Note"] = "꼬깃꼬깃한 쪽지"
L["A Daughter's Love"] = "딸의 사랑"
L["A Discreet Matter"] = "은밀한 용무"
